ag":"_t","target":"这不可思议的金属链覆盖着极度寒霜，向外放射出诡异而强大的光环能量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09a5ce5f9341b5e9bf13f931b14236b879679788693a6cb592811820c5b08ac2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3209e335ef786b49a55b62373e4e496909881d31584567dffddfd57959f722db","logical_entry_identity":"125edf63bf6386cc4b925405b9571fc430aee0fb1600deca0034cab644474a0a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Control your movements to increase your defenses. This allows you to shrug off minor damage and, if you have a shield equipped, preemptively Block in reaction to incoming damage.  \n\t\tWhile this talent is activated, you are globally slowed by %0.1f%% and all damage you take is reduced by a flat %0.1f.\n\t\tIf you have a shield equipped and Block is not on cooldown, any blockable damage that is greater than 33%% of your block value (before resistances) will have a %d%% chance to instantly activate Block.\n\t\tThe flat damage reduction will increase with your defense.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"控制你的动作来强化你的防御。这可以让你对轻微的伤害不屑一顾，如果你装备了盾牌，你可以先发制人地格挡来袭的伤害。\n\t\t激活这一技能时，你的全局速度降低 %0.1f%%，你所受的所有伤害固定减少 %0.1f。\n\t\t如果你装备了盾牌，并且格挡技能未在冷却中，任何高于格挡值 33%% 的可格挡伤害（计算抗性前）都有 %d%% 几率立即激活格挡。\n\t\t固定伤害减免受闪避值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be373ab7c718bc42ce320b6f7440bba6d2d165e14810bebb1d8b9e570c0c716b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"320aacaa8190d456eda5aab68807a0f6cb5d11b2553cf62a53a63ee1c8de786e","logical_entry_identity":"6840c9de6e66084bd24ba7a69d1d5f063f6197a535f9c5693bb82a2048160fb2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is able to burrow into walls, and additionally has %d more APR and %d%% more physical resistance penetration.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标可以挖入墙中，获得%d护甲穿透，%d%%物理抗性穿透。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ebb30f144a473ca669fdfa45e6be63aa92aa8b3e933c2b7b6d19f4b3b24ab43e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"320f384918dbd7794b94e83501d0097f288bffeb1dee91173fc5f9a8c004034f","logical_entry_identity":"ef5d3c1dddf4618b5